About the character

Claudia is an open character created by anabology (https://claudia.gallery).
The pixel-art frames in art/, docs/ and .claude-plugin/icon.png are a fan
redraw of that character. The MIT license above covers this repository's code
and these drawings as far as this project's own work goes; it does not grant
any rights in the Claudia character itself, which remain with anabology under
the terms they publish. Please credit "Claudia by anabology" when you reuse the
character. This project is not affiliated with anabology or with Anthropic.
